  "story": {
    "logline": "An absurdly over-specific \"did you know\": three conditions (Tucumán, named Mati, radioactive mate) each get a tick, he dies, and the anticlimax: if you are called Juan, too.",
    "facts": [
      "A dose of about 4–5 sieverts at once kills about half of the people exposed (LD50)."
    ]
  },
